; BIND Zone file for ezyschool.in
; Optimized for Hostinger DNS Zone Import & GitHub Pages
$ORIGIN ezyschool.in.
$TTL 14400

; ============================================
; 1. GitHub Pages A Records (Apex / Root Domain)
; ============================================
@       14400   IN      A       185.199.108.153
@       14400   IN      A       185.199.109.153
@       14400   IN      A       185.199.110.153
@       14400   IN      A       185.199.111.153

; ============================================
; 2. CNAME Record for www Subdomain
; (Points to your GitHub Pages: gvpapps.github.io)
; ============================================
www     14400   IN      CNAME   gvpapps.github.io.
